  "title": {
   "en": "Friedrich's Battlefield"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "フリードリヒの戦場　深紅の天才軍師、嘘から始める英雄譚"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Friedrich, a once-orphaned but brilliant young man, lived a quiet and peaceful life in a rural village. However, that peace was abruptly shattered by a raid from a band of thieves. While the villagers were consumed by despair, Friedrich stood apart—he stepped forward before the people and spoke:\n\n\"I am the son of a hero. If you follow my plan, we will surely win!\"\n\nThis is the story of a young man who was once a nobody, rising to become a great hero whose name would be etched into history."
  },
